  <Vertical id="cause_connection_3_explanation_choice">
    <SplitPanel id="cause_connection_3_explanation_choice_panel">
     <LeftPane>
      <Use id="cause_connection_3c" ref="cause_connection_3" />
      <Markdown>
    **Select the best sentences to use in the summary.**</Markdown>
      <ChoiceInput id="cause_connection_3_explanation_choice_input">
        <Distractor>
Family factors can affect students who are at risk of dropping out due to ADHD status.
        </Distractor>
        <Distractor>
          <Ref target="cause_connection_3_explanation" />
        </Distractor>
        <Key><TextBlock id="factor_connection_1_key">
It may be harder to locate and afford needed services for a student with ADHD if
the family has limited assets or is influenced by other family characteristics,
such as the presence of both parents or maternal education, which are reported by
research as key determinants.
        </TextBlock></Key>
      </ChoiceInput>
      <IntakeGate ready="@cause_connection_3_explanation_choice_input.value">
        <Hidden id="hidden_7"> </Hidden>
        <Vertical id="factor_connection_3_explanation_block">
