    <Tabs id="reading_funding_insight_choice">
     <SplitPanel id="reading_funding_insight_choice_panel" title="Choose the Best Insight Sentence">
      <LeftPane>
        <Markdown>
**Click on the insight summary that you consider the best.**
        </Markdown>
        <ChoiceInput id="source5_insight_selection">
          <Distractor>
            <TextBlock id="best_reading_funding_d1">
Just 10% increase in per-pupil spending increased completed schooling raising likelihood of high school graduation.
            </TextBlock>
          </Distractor>
          <Key>
            <TextBlock id="best_reading_funding_insight_sentence">
Sustained increases in school spending significantly improve educational attainment, adult earnings, and poverty outcomes—especially for low-income students—show that equitable school finance reforms are powerful tools for reducing inequality and promoting economic mobility.
            </TextBlock>
          </Key>
          <Distractor id="best_reading_funding_d2"><Ref target="source_5_insight_sentence" /></Distractor>
          <Distractor id="best_reading_funding_d3">
            <TextBlock>
Participants who were exposed to that school funding increase saw increased wages and family income when they reached adulthood. Poverty rates were lower too because of it.
            </TextBlock>
          </Distractor>
          <Distractor id="best_reading_funding_d4">
            <TextBlock>
Sustained increases in school spending significantly improve educational attainment, adult earnings, and poverty outcomes.
            </TextBlock>
          </Distractor>
        </ChoiceInput>
        </LeftPane>
        <RightPane>
          <IntakeGate id="reading_funding_insight_choice_explanation_gate" ready="@source5_insight_selection.value">
            <Hidden id="hidden_16"> </Hidden>
            <Vertical id="reading_funding_insight_choice_explanation_panel">
               <Markdown>**Why did you choose this insight summary?**</Markdown>
               <TextArea id="source_5_insight_sentence_explanation" placeholder="Put your reason for selecting this explanation here" />
            </Vertical>
          </IntakeGate>
        </RightPane>
     </SplitPanel>
     <Vertical id="reading_funding_insight_choice_panel2" title="School Funding Study">
       <Use ref="reading_funding_highlighted" />
     </Vertical>
    </Tabs>
    
    <Tabs id="best_reading_funding_insight_sentence_display">
      <Vertical id="best_reading_funding_insight_sentence_display_t1" title="Insight Sentence">
        <Markdown>
**Best Insight Sentence for this Passage**
        </Markdown>
        <Use ref="best_reading_funding_insight_sentence" />
      </Vertical>
     <Vertical id="best_reading_funding_insight_sentence_display_t2" title="School Funding Study">
       <Use ref="reading_funding_highlighted" />
     </Vertical>
   </Tabs>

